    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Back to the College</strong> is a <strong>choice-based visual novel</strong> where every decision shapes your story. After a fatal incident, a brilliant but troubled lawyer is given a second chance\u2014in the unexpected form of a 25 years old guy\u2019s body. Guided by a clumsy angel and a seductive demon, you must navigate your new life, uncover hidden secrets, and decide what kind of person you want to become... this time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features a <strong>rich cast of diverse and memorable characters</strong>, each with their own goals, secrets, and potential relationships. Will you flirt, investigate, betray, or protect? It\u2019s up to you. Every path leads to different consequences, and no two playthroughs will be the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in a mysterious academic world where law, love, and the supernatural collide, <strong>Back to the College</strong> offers a unique narrative experience full of romance, tension, and dark humor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choice-driven storytelling</strong>: your decisions shape the plot and relationships</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple endings</strong> based on your actions, alliances, and moral choices</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interact with a large and varied cast</strong>: wonderful woman, professors, faculty, angels, demons, and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Romantic routes, mysteries to solve, and secrets to uncover</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Philosophical and legal dilemmas</strong> presented through dialogue and in-game events</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Back to the College</strong> is a <strong>choice-based visual novel</strong> where every decision shapes your story. After a fatal incident, a brilliant but troubled lawyer is given a second chance\u2014in the unexpected form of a 25 years old guy\u2019s body. Guided by a clumsy angel and a seductive demon, you must navigate your new life, uncover hidden secrets, and decide what kind of person you want to become... this time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features a <strong>rich cast of diverse and memorable characters</strong>, each with their own goals, secrets, and potential relationships. Will you flirt, investigate, betray, or protect? It\u2019s up to you. Every path leads to different consequences, and no two playthroughs will be the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in a mysterious academic world where law, love, and the supernatural collide, <strong>Back to the College</strong> offers a unique narrative experience full of romance, tension, and dark humor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choice-driven storytelling</strong>: your decisions shape the plot and relationships</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple endings</strong> based on your actions, alliances, and moral choices</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interact with a large and varied cast</strong>: wonderful woman, professors, faculty, angels, demons, and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Romantic routes, mysteries to solve, and secrets to uncover</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Philosophical and legal dilemmas</strong> presented through dialogue and in-game events</p></li></ul>",
